$ .efs/help 
EFS commands for this directory

Usage:
  .efs/COMMAND [options]

Commands:
  ls                    List immediate children
  find PATTERN          Search names recursively
  stats                 Show directory and subtree totals
  help                  Show this help

Options:
  --json                Structured results and snapshot details
  -0                    NUL-separated paths (ls and find)
  --extended            Show limits and requirements (help)
  -h, --help            Show command-specific help

Examples:
  .efs/find report
  .efs/find .txt --match suffix
  .efs/stats --json

Notes:
  Run any command with --help for its options.
  Use .efs/help --extended for limits and requirements.

